        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSPA4080 4\" x 8\" Parliament Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n4\" by 8\" Residential Parliament Hinge. 0.157\" thick. Tooled for a tight knuckle action. A parliament hinge is a butt hinge where the knuckle protrudes from the door so that the door when fully opened stands away from the wall. Designed for doors that need to swing 180° and clear a projection such as a decorative molding around the door frame. It is often used on windows and shutters because this type of hinge allow them to swing past deep trim work. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a set of two hinges and wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSPA4080-specifications.gif?v=1704354773\" width=\"503\" height=\"348\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSPA4080 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness (gauge): 0.157\"</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1-1/4\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Extruded</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSPA4080.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSPA4080 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>Item is being discontinued, Limited Quantities available. </b><!-- <b>See available <a href=\"/collections/deltana-parliament-hinges\">Parliament Hinges</a></b>-->\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
